    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know, I once wondered if, in the future, there would be restaurants in space. Like\u2014how would people or aliens, or whatever else is out there\u2014sit down to eat? What kind of food would they even have? Would they pay with money, digital credits, or something completely wild?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That little question stuck with me, and that\u2019s how <i>Pizzy6</i> was born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Pizzy6</i>, you start with nothing and slowly build a floating restaurant in space. You can unlock a wide variety of features: customize lighting, decorate with wall art, and even build entire new floors that stretch upward into the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll place tables, pizza makers, and other machines \u2014 each of which can be upgraded. Improve pizza-making speed, adjust baking timers, increase storage capacity, or enhance customer flow. The inventory system lets you level up everything from pizza pricing to how fast customers arrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your pizzeria grows, strange things begin to happen. You might unlock a mysterious portal where massive aliens\u2014sometimes 20 times larger than normal customers\u2014emerge to devour all your prepared food in a single visit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and expand a customizable space restaurant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve strange interstellar customers and earn space credits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade machines, decor, pricing, and gameplay systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock higher floors and unexpected secrets as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter rare visitors through mysterious events</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819010/extras/92437f4e18d0fdab2bd829527984043f.poster.avif?t=1754013099\" width=500 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819010/extras/92437f4e18d0fdab2bd829527984043f.webm?t=1754013099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819010/extras/92437f4e18d0fdab2bd829527984043f.mp4?t=1754013099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know, I once wondered if, in the future, there would be restaurants in space. Like\u2014how would people or aliens, or whatever else is out there\u2014sit down to eat? What kind of food would they even have? Would they pay with money, digital credits, or something completely wild?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That little question stuck with me, and that\u2019s how <i>Pizzy6</i> was born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Pizzy6</i>, you start with nothing and slowly build a floating restaurant in space. You can unlock a wide variety of features: customize lighting, decorate with wall art, and even build entire new floors that stretch upward into the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll place tables, pizza makers, and other machines \u2014 each of which can be upgraded. Improve pizza-making speed, adjust baking timers, increase storage capacity, or enhance customer flow. The inventory system lets you level up everything from pizza pricing to how fast customers arrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your pizzeria grows, strange things begin to happen. You might unlock a mysterious portal where massive aliens\u2014sometimes 20 times larger than normal customers\u2014emerge to devour all your prepared food in a single visit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and expand a customizable space restaurant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve strange interstellar customers and earn space credits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade machines, decor, pricing, and gameplay systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock higher floors and unexpected secrets as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter rare visitors through mysterious events</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819010/extras/92437f4e18d0fdab2bd829527984043f.poster.avif?t=1754013099\" width=500 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819010/extras/92437f4e18d0fdab2bd829527984043f.webm?t=1754013099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819010/extras/92437f4e18d0fdab2bd829527984043f.mp4?t=1754013099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
